{"text": "Once there were twenty five tin soldiers in a wooden box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were all brothers, because they were made from one old spoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tin soldiers, shouted a little boy when he opened the box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were his birthday present, and he was very happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The soldiers wore red and blue uniforms and carried guns on their shoulders. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They all looked the same, except for the last soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had only one leg, because there was not enough tin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he stood on one leg as firmly as the others stood on two. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the table there were many other toys to play with. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The most wonderful toy of all was a paper castle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through its little windows, you could see into the rooms.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "c", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "f", "i", "v", "e", " ", "t", "i", "n", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", "e", "n", " ", "b", "o", "x", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "b", "r", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "s", "p", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "i", "n", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "t", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "o", 